   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The South’s reaction to John Quincy Adams and the gag rule was to",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1169517,
     "content_html": "grow more adamant in support of the institution of slavery"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169516,
     "content_html": "propose a constitutional amendment to protect slavery where it existed"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169515,
     "content_html": "promise not to expand slavery westward"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169514,
     "content_html": "propose compromises to maintain a peaceful relationship between North and South"
    }
